<title>USA: SilverPlatter 1995 revenues higher than 1994.</title>
<headline>SilverPlatter 1995 revenues higher than 1994.</headline>
<dateline>NORWOOD, Mass. 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>SilverPlatter International N.V. said on Friday 1995 revenues for the full year were $60 million compared with $42 million in the previous year.</p>
<p>The company said revenues figures for the 1996 mid-year stand at $37.1 million, up 26 percent from the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>SilverPlatter provides electronic access to bibliographic and full-text databases using technology through local, intranet and Internet access.</p>
<p>A company spokesperson said further details for earnings were not available.</p>
</text>
